"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Russia continued its attacks overnight. President Volodymyr Zelensky warned that Ukraine is running low on missile interceptors. Ukrainian emergency workers are warning about more Russian attacks on hospitals and ambulances.\",            \"english_title\": \"Russia Attacks Continue\",            \"translated_version\": \"Rusia sigui\u00f3 atacando en la noche. El presidente Volodymyr Zelensky dijo que Ucrania tiene pocos interceptores de misiles. Los trabajadores de emergencia de Ucrania advierten sobre m\u00e1s ataques rusos a hospitales y ambulancias.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Ataques de Rusia Contin\u00faan\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Republican Senator Bill Cassidy was the deciding vote after a long disagreement. This decision was important in the political landscape.\",            \"english_title\": \"Senator's Deciding Vote\",            \"translated_version\": \"El senador republicano Bill Cassidy fue el voto decisivo despu\u00e9s de un largo desacuerdo. Esta decisi\u00f3n fue importante en la pol\u00edtica.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Voto Decisivo del Senador\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Pakistan stated that an attack on any of the three countries involved in the Middle East conflict would be considered an attack on all of them.\",            \"english_title\": \"Pakistan's Warning\",            \"translated_version\": \"Pakist\u00e1n dijo que un ataque a cualquiera de los tres pa\u00edses en el conflicto del Medio Oriente ser\u00eda considerado un ataque a todos.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Advertencia de Pakist\u00e1n\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Italy started border controls because about 78,000 migrants came from Morocco into the Spanish area of Ceuta.\",            \"english_title\": \"Italy's Border Controls\",            \"translated_version\": \"Italia comenz\u00f3 controles fronterizos porque unos 78,000 migrantes vinieron de Marruecos al \u00e1rea espa\u00f1ola de Ceuta.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Controles Fronterizos de Italia\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A 14-year-old shot and killed eight people at his home and school before taking his own life.\",            \"english_title\": \"Tragic Shooting Incident\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un ni\u00f1o de 14 a\u00f1os dispar\u00f3 y mat\u00f3 a ocho personas en su casa y escuela antes de quitarse la vida.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Incidente de Tiroteo Tr\u00e1gico\"        }    ]}"